  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to the Cuban Ministry of Finance and Prices - 1st mission</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Technick&#xe1; asistencia pre Ministerstvo financi&#xed; a cien Kuby - 1. misia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Poskytnutie technickej asistencie na z&#xe1;klade ak&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho pl&#xe1;nu medzi MF SR a MFaC Kuby na rok 2016. Misia sa uskuto&#x10d;nila v term&#xed;ne 25.-29.1.2016 a bola zameran&#xe1; na t&#xe9;my rozpo&#x10d;tu a dan&#xed;, napr. rozpo&#x10d;tov&#xfd; proces, financovanie &#xfa;zemnej samospr&#xe1;vy, legislat&#xed;vu pre &#xfa;&#x10d;ely spr&#xe1;vy dan&#xed;, v&#xfd;menu inform&#xe1;ci&#xed; na da&#x148;ov&#xe9; &#xfa;&#x10d;ely a pod.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Technical assistance mission based on an action plan for 2016 between the Slovak Ministry of Finance and Cuban Ministry of Finance and Prices. The mission took place on 25-29 January 2016 and was focused on knowledge exchange in budget and tax issues, such as budgetary process, financing of self-governmental units, administration of taxes legislation, exchange of information for tax purposes and similar.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
